# Topic access control (least privilege)

# backend: reads everything from robots, sends commands + heartbeats
user backend
topic read robot/#
topic write robot/+/commands
topic write robot/+/heartbeat

# robot01: may only publish its own data and read its own commands
user robot01
topic write robot/robot01/telemetry
topic write robot/robot01/events
topic write robot/robot01/acks
topic write robot/robot01/status
topic write robot/robot01/info
topic read robot/robot01/commands
topic read robot/robot01/heartbeat
